## 🎨 BRAND SYSTEM - Visual Identity Rules

**CRITICAL:** All visual elements must use the centralized brand system.

**Brand Sources (SINGLE SOURCE OF TRUTH):**
- `src/lib/brand/colors.ts` — All colors
- `src/lib/brand/assets.ts` — All logos and images
- `public/assets/brand/` — Physical assets folder

**Strict Rules:**
❌ **FORBIDDEN:**
- Writing Hex codes directly (#3D6833, #FDD12A, etc.)
- Using Tailwind color classes (bg-green-500, text-blue-600)
- Adding images outside `public/assets/brand/`
- Creating color variables outside the brand system

✅ **REQUIRED:**
- Import colors from `@/lib/brand/colors`
- Import assets from `@/lib/brand/assets`
- Use `BRAND_COLORS` or `SEMANTIC_COLORS` constants
- Use `BRAND_ASSETS` for all logos/images

**Example (Correct):**
```tsx
import { SEMANTIC_COLORS } from "@/lib/brand/colors";
import { BRAND_ASSETS } from "@/lib/brand/assets";

<button style={{ backgroundColor: SEMANTIC_COLORS.buttonPrimary }}>
  Login
</button>
<img src={BRAND_ASSETS.logo.full} alt="Logo" />
```

**Full documentation:** `docs/BRAND_SYSTEM.md`

